+This local distribution is named **QuantTrade** and uses the Pairlens terminal.
+The title, wordmark, onboarding and local terminal controls carry that name.
+Pairlens Cloud, Intelligence, plugin publishers and source attribution keep
+their original names because they refer to upstream services and authors.
